# SiloOS's context: its own folder and the host daemon's binary (`make
# build-siloosd`), nothing else. podman is handed this file with --ignorefile
# (`make os-image`); data/, silo.yaml and .git never reach the builder.
*
!images/os
!build/bin/siloosd
images/os/bib.toml
images/os/config.toml
images/os/cloud-init/user-data.yaml
images/os/cloud-init/meta-data.yaml
